        "content": "<div style='padding:4px 10px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5'><b style='font-size:18px;color:#D4AC0D'>4 → 34</b><br>Countdown to Christmas <i>started with just four original movies</i> in 2009 (Hallmark). In 2026 Hallmark Channel is premiering <b>34</b>, a record for the channel.<br><br><b>2025's dip to 24:</b> that season the sister network (Hallmark Mystery) launched <b>no</b> new Christmas films, and Hallmark Channel premiered 24.<br><br><b>Why curated?</b> Wikidata tags only 69 Hallmark Channel Christmas films <i>in total</i>, and press totals mix networks (2018 is reported as 34, 36, 37 or 38). Every bar here has a single definition and a cited source.</div>"
